<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fort Howard lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fort Howard lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it downgraded Fort Howard Corp to buy from strong buy, removing the stock from its focus list of recommended stocks.</p>
<p>-- On Monday Fort Howard and James River Corp announced a $5.8 billion merger.</p>
<p>-- Fort Howard was off 3/4 at 41-3/4.</p>
</text>
